title:: BMBoid
summary:: Documentation BEASTmulch - represents a single boid in a BMBoidSpace
categories:: Classes

Description::

BMBoid represents a single boid (i.e. flock member) in a link::Classes/Other/Swarm Granulation/BMBoidSpace::. Normally you would not create these directly, rather they are created and controlled by BMBoidSpace for you. As such all its methods should be considered 'private'. See link::Classes/Other/Swarm Granulation/BMBoidSpace:: for examples.

warning::This implementation is still experimental and should be considered subject to change in future versions of the library.::

See also: link::Classes/Other/Swarm Granulation/BMBoidSpace::, link::Classes/Other/Swarm Granulation/BMSwarmGranulator::

INSTANCEMETHODS::

method:: pos
Returns this boid's current position as an link::Classes/Array:: of the same size as this boid's link::Classes/Other/Swarm Granulation/BMBoidSpace::'s number of dimensions, e.g. [x, y, z] for a three dimensional space.
